==Battleground==
*15 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 2.67~8 seconds<sup>80f~240f</sup>.
*10 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ghost Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Nimoy Bore]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**6 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 5.33~8.67 seconds<sup>160f~260f</sup>.
**3 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Units like [[Seafarer Cat]] and [[Corrupted Psychocat]] can help stall the [[Nimoy Bore]], [[Can Can Cat]] and [[Pizza Cat]] can help with damage and tanking.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Ancient Egg: N105 (Rare Cat)|Racquet Cat]]: It can knock the Aliens back behind the base, skipping the need to fight the enemies entirely. Since the Aliens are decently buffed, this can speed up the level quite a lot.
*[[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]]: Whether [[Cheese|cheesing]] the stage or beating it legitimately, Soap Cat is invaluable here. It has huge defense vs Aliens, and high speed to gain more ground when the Aliens are knocked back.
*[[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack Cat]]: Similar to Soap Cat, except as a meatshield. Can be replaced by [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat]] if you don't have it, but Rover is less effective due to being slower and having less effective health.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Thunder Jack (Uber Rare Cat)|Thunder Jack]]: Similar to Racquet Cat, only with more speed, cost and attack rate.
*Any anti-Alien Ubers such as any [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Elemental Pixie]] or [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] exclusives. All their abilities against Aliens can carry you through this stage.

==Trivia==
*The name of this stage appears to reference the [[Wikipedia:Pokémon|Pokémon]] franchise's famous catchphrase "Gotta Catch 'Em All". However, it is also more than likely a nod to [[Wikipedia:Ghostbusters|Ghostbusters]] given the ghoulish context, and Enemy Base being the [[Wikipedia:Statue of Liberty|Statue of Liberty]].

